              "required": true,
              "reveal": {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Azure DNS hosts DNS zones and records using Azure infrastructure. A DNS zone is authoritative for a domain namespace after the domain is delegated to the Azure DNS name servers."
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "az104-d4-n09-why",
              "kind": "when",
              "label": "WHY IT MATTERS",
              "placeholder": "",
              "required": true,
              "reveal": {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "DNS converts names into records such as IP addresses; it does not purchase or register the domain name for you."
              }
            },
            {
